        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dana Carvey, Chris Farley, Rob Lowe, Tia Carrere, Lara Flynn Boyle, Brian Doyle-Murray, Ed O'Neill, Ione Skye, Meat Loaf, Alice Cooper\n- Products: Wayne's World, Wayne's World 2, Saturday Night Live\n- Organizations: Second City Theatre, NBC\n- Roles: Garth Algar\n- Topics: Comedy acting, cast membership\n\nFacts:\n- Dana Carvey was born on June 2, 1955.\n- Dana Carvey is an American actor and stand-up comedian.\n- Dana Carvey was a cast member on Saturday Night Live from 1986 to 1993.\n- Chris Farley was a member of Chicago's Second City Theatre.\n- Chris Farley was known for a loud, energetic comedic style.\n- Chris Farley was a cast member of NBC's Saturday Night Live from 1990 to 1995.\n- Wayne's World was released in 1992.\n- Dana Carvey played Garth Algar in Wayne's World.\n- Wayne's World features Rob Lowe, Tia Carrere, Lara Flynn Boyle, Brian Doyle-Murray, Chris Farley, Ed O'Neill, Ione Skye, Meat Loaf, and Alice Cooper.\n- Wayne's World 2 was released in 1993.\n- Dana Carvey played Garth Algar in Wayne's World 2.",
